# ERASING lives in the EDIT LIST now (TRACKS, EDIT; white 12 ERASE NOTES, 13 ERASE AUTO, 14 ERASE ALL): the first press asks,
# the second (within 3 s) does it, each one undo step. ERASE ALL is this part only (every track). No timed REC hold erases any more.
wait 300
demo
wait 100
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
mark
listen
# REC held 3 s with nothing else: nothing is erased, and no take starts on letting go
press REC
wait 3000
release REC
wait 50
expect events >0
expect recording 0
expect counting 0
page 11
tap LFO
wait 100
expect layview 1
shot p40_edit_erase.png
tapkey w11
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
expect events >0
shot p41_edit_erase_ask.png
tapkey w11
wait 100
said NOTES ERASED
expect events 0
expect eventsB1 >0
press LFO
wait 800
release LFO
wait 50
expect same 1
# this part, every track: notes go; the other parts stay. one undo step
tapkey w13
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
tapkey w13
wait 100
said PART CLEARED
expect events 0
expect eventsB1 >0
expect eventsC1 >0
press LFO
wait 800
release LFO
wait 50
expect same 1
expect events >0
# another item between the asks forgets the ask
tapkey w11
wait 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
tapkey w11
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
expect events >0
tap LFO
wait 50
expect layview 0
# a tap is still a recording
tap REC
wait 100
expect counting >0
tap REC
wait 100
# ROAD: the third block chosen, PLAY in SONG plays from it
tap ENV
wait 50
turn K1 2
wait 50
expect part 2
turn K4 1
wait 50
expect playmode 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect part 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect textfit 0
